{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gz2rpp","slideIndex":3,"text":"2:20–3:30\n\nDescribe the lecture connection. The contact pair must lie inside both friction cones under the nominal coefficient μ = 0.5. The method then checks reachability and collision-free arm motion. Clarify that the ranking is a heuristic, not a full six-dimensional force-closure metric.\n\nSource: readme.md lecture correspondence; grasping.py and controller.py"}
