{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/5qqq40","slideIndex":8,"text":"7:30–8:45\n\nSeparate evidence from hypotheses. The evidence is the sharp gap between stationary hold and transport. The likely reasons come from the controller design: static geometric ranking, a large carry reorientation, nominal friction, and no closed-loop slip response. Avoid claiming that any single cause has already been proven.\n\nSource: Measured evidence: results/grasping and results/full_task. Mechanism analysis: grasping.py, controller.py, and full_task.py"}
