{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/d74p57","slideIndex":9,"text":"8:45–10:00\n\nClose with the plan in priority order. First collect evidence that distinguishes rotation slip from base-motion slip. Then change the grasp score and carry motion, and finally add recovery. End with the takeaway: the system integration is complete, but reliable grasp retention is the remaining blocker before submission.\n\nSource: Planned work based on measured failure modes and current controller structure"}